review_comments:
Another pattern you will see in the codebase is to use `params` parameter of `toXContent(XContentBuilder builder, Params params)` to control when the internal fields should be written:

```
if params['include_internal_fields'] {
  // write dimensions_set_by_user
}
```

Both are good, your approach is more explicit which is always good.
